      "reply": {
        "answer": "A VORTAC is a ground navigation aid that provides VOR azimuth, TACAN azimuth, and TACAN distance. It operates on paired VHF and UHF bands, so that the VOR and TACAN channels are paired and azimuth and distance come from the same station. A TACAN-equipped aircraft receives distance from it automatically.",
